<title>HONG KONG: ABN AMRO Bank sets Cheung Kong warrants.</title>
<headline>ABN AMRO Bank sets Cheung Kong warrants.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1996-12-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>ABN AMRO Bank N.V. said on Thursday it intends to issue 78 million American-style call warrants on shares of Cheung Kong (Holdings) Ltd.</p>
<p>Ten warrants control one share.</p>
<p> STRIKE PRICE	HK$64.22     PREMIUM	    UNAVAILABLE</p>
<p> ISSUE PRICE	 HK$1.095     GEARING	    6.2X</p>
<p> EXPIRATION	  12.DEC.97    MIN EXER LOT     10,000</p>
<p> LISTING	     HONG KONG    PAYMENT DATE     06.JAN.97</p>
<p> SPOT REFERENCE    HK$67.6	LEAD MANAGER     HG ASIA LTD</p>
<p> NOTE		  CASH SETTLEMENT OR PHYSICAL DELIVERY AT</p>
<p>			 ISSUER'S OPTION</p>
<p>-- Hong Kong Newsroom (852) 2843 6370</p>
</text>
